## Configuration

Set with `ext` in a `process` `withName` selector:

| Option | Description |
|---|---|
| `ext.properties` | Map of {{ block }} properties (see below){% if default_properties != "[:]" %}. Defaults: `{{ default_properties }}`{% endif %} |
| `ext.outputs` | Map of output argument to extension (for example `[{{ outputs[0].name }}: '{{ outputs[0].formats[0] }}']`). Optional outputs set to `false` are not requested |
| `ext.prefix` | Output file prefix (default: `meta.id`) |

`raise_error` and `restart` are always set by the adapter: failed commands fail the task, and `-resume` replaces restart.
Do not set the `container_*` properties: Nextflow runs the task inside the {{ package }} container.

```groovy
process {
    withName: '{{ process_name }}' {
        ext.properties = [{{ example_properties }}]
    }
}
```

